gabagool v2.26.6 (commit 9776c2a): an application hook for the NextUI power
button (openspec change add-handheld-controller, design D5).

Options.PowerButtonHook func(long bool), when set, is called on the power
button's goroutine instead of running the suspend script (long false) or the
power-off command (long true), so the application can act first (Spooder's
handheld requests Sleep and waits for the robot to confirm it). Unset, the
behaviour is unchanged. Applied by `mise run handheld-fork`; meant upstream.

diff --git a/pkg/gabagool/init.go b/pkg/gabagool/init.go
